{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Arslan Senki (TV) OVA","It has been announced that Hiromu Arakawa's Arslan Senki manga will bundle OVAs in the fifth and sixth volumes, to be released on May 9 and December 9 respectively. \n \n\n\nEpisode 1 (The Road of Blood and Love): Arslan gets to spend some time with Gieve alone, so Gieve decides to tells some interesting stories about Narsus, Daryun and Elam's past love lives.\n\n\nEpisode 2  (Banquet of Friendship): The battle between Rajendra and Gadevi has ended. Arslan and the others prepare to leave Shindra but will first spend some time in the castle."],"ja":["アルスラーン戦記 (TV) OVA",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-33254","ids":{"shikimori":33254,"mal":33254,"anilist":21817,"kodik":"serial-33733"},"kodikIds":["serial-33732","serial-33733"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-33732":"2021-04-04T11:13:59Z","serial-33733":"2021-04-04T11:18:46Z"},"title":"Сказание об Арслане OVA (2016)","originalTitle":"Arslan Senki OAD","alt":"アルスラーン戦記 OAD","description":"Два оригинальных эпизода, выпущенные в качестве бонусов к пятому и шестому томам манги за авторством Хирому Аракавы .","year":2016,"type":"OVA","genres":["Сёнен","Приключения","Фэнтези","исторический"],"rating":6.98,"popularity":0,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/33254/abda1566208ad7c9affb818932fb215a.jpeg","width":354,"height":512},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/6f49e3656bb76d4929fd112fd9f49f9658d07666.jpg","width":848,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-825","dubId":"825","label":"AniMaunt","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-33732","translationId":"825","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/813982/b08a75a7fb10d76eb805300169f